Halls of Peril~
Dark, shifting walls press in on all sides of you here, threatening to
engulf you. Not a sound permeates the dizzying, moving dark shapes, nor
does your light source penetrate far into the gloom. Shapes move about on
all sides of you, adding to your confusion. Panic sets in as you also realize
that in this evil place your magic will not function either.
~
